Recommendations
Establish a National Water Commission
Create an independent body to coordinate and oversee urban water management across all levels of government.

Develop a National Water Strategy
Develop a comprehensive national water strategy with clear targets, timelines, and accountability measures.

Invest in Water Infrastructure
Prioritize investment in water infrastructure, with a focus on replacing aging systems and building climate resilience.

Strengthen Water Governance
Strengthen water governance at all levels, with clear roles, responsibilities, and accountability mechanisms.

Promote Water Conservation
Promote water conservation and efficiency through pricing reforms, public awareness campaigns, and incentive programs.

Ensure Universal Access
Ensure universal access to clean water by 2030, with specific programs targeting underserved communities.